<view class="page">
	<view class="hero">
		<view class="eyebrow">REAL TEST FLOW</view>
		<view class="title">一键挂号 · 选择支付方式</view>
		<view class="subtitle">只保留就诊人、号源和支付三个决策</view>
	</view>

	<view class="card">
		<view class="label">就诊人</view>
		<picker mode="selector" range="{{patientNames}}" value="{{patientIndex}}" bindchange="onPatientChange" disabled="{{busy}}">
			<view class="picker-row">
				<text class="value">{{patientIndex >= 0 ? patientNames[patientIndex] : '请选择就诊人'}}</text>
				<text class="arrow">›</text>
			</view>
		</picker>
		<view wx:if="{{patientIndex >= 0}}" class="muted patient-meta">{{patientRelation}} · {{patientCard}}</view>
	</view>

	<view class="card">
		<view class="label">固定预约条件</view>
		<view class="condition-row"><text>门诊</text><text class="value">内科风湿</text></view>
		<view class="condition-row"><text>日期</text><text class="value">{{targetDate}}</text></view>
		<view class="condition-row"><text>时段</text><text class="value">上午</text></view>
		<view wx:if="{{schedule}}" class="schedule-detail">
			<view class="doctor">{{schedule.doctorName}}</view>
			<view class="muted">{{schedule.departmentName}} · {{schedule.availableSlots}} 个可预约号源</view>
			<view wx:if="{{schedule.totalFen}}" class="muted">服务端核定挂号费 {{schedule.totalFen / 100}} 元</view>
		</view>
		<view wx:if="{{source}}" class="source-detail">
			<view class="source-title">已选分时段号源</view>
			<view class="source-time">{{source.timeLabel}}</view>
			<view class="muted">{{source.serialNumber}} 号 · 写入预约前由服务端重新核验</view>
		</view>
	</view>

	<view wx:if="{{duplicate}}" class="duplicate-card">
		<view class="duplicate-title">该就诊人当天已有同门诊预约</view>
		<view class="duplicate-text">{{duplicate.departmentName}} · {{duplicate.workDate}} · 已预约</view>
		<view class="duplicate-hint">系统不会自动重复挂号。确认取消原预约后，才会重新选择同一号源并发起医保支付。</view>
		<button class="button danger-button" bindtap="onCancelAndRetry" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">取消后重新挂号</button>
	</view>

	<view wx:if="{{message}}" class="status-card">
		<view class="status-dot {{stage}}"></view>
		<view class="status-message">{{message}}</view>
		<view wx:if="{{stage === 'success'}}" class="success">最终结算已确认</view>
	</view>
	<view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card error-card"><text class="error">{{error}}</text></view>

	<view class="payment-label">选择支付方式</view>
	<view class="payment-actions">
		<button class="button payment-button medical-button" data-mode="medical" bindtap="onRegisterAndPay" loading="{{busy && selectedMode === 'medical'}}" disabled="{{busy || (!hasPendingPayment && (patientIndex < 0 || !source || duplicate))}}">医保支付</button>
		<button class="button payment-button mixed-button" data-mode="mixed" bindtap="onRegisterAndPay" loading="{{busy && selectedMode === 'mixed'}}" disabled="{{busy || (!hasPendingPayment && (patientIndex < 0 || !source || duplicate))}}">医保混合支付</button>
		<button class="button payment-button self-button" data-mode="self" bindtap="onRegisterAndPay" loading="{{busy && selectedMode === 'self'}}" disabled="{{busy || (!hasPendingPayment && (patientIndex < 0 || !source || duplicate))}}">自费支付</button>
	</view>
	<view class="footnote">支付完成以医院最终结算结果为准；取消授权或支付不会重复挂号，当前预约会保留。</view>
</view>
